2. In paper_benchmark_merged.md section 7.4:
   - grep "temporal" or "snapshot" -> finds G10 passage
   - grep "multilingual" or "language" -> finds G13 caveat on scaling
   - grep "ontolog" -> finds G11 schema-lock sentence
   - grep "official statistics" or "Principle 7" -> finds G12 framing
3. In report/report.tex:
   - grep "multilingue" near line 539 -> inline caveat present
   - grep "temporel" or "instantané" near line 542 -> inline caveat
4. No HTML placeholder comments remain in section 7.4 (all replaced
